  "id": "interpretive-phenomenological-analysis",
  "term": "interpretive phenomenological analysis",
  "definition": "Interpretive phenomenological analysis is an approach for examining people’s reflected experiences by interpreting personal accounts such as diaries and interviews. In this study, it was used to explore how teachers made sense of emotionally charged incidents in their daily work.",
